{"created": "2026-10-30T12:07:15.489058+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-30T12:28:37.889228+00:00", "id": 23804087, "conceptrecid": "23804086", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23804087", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23804086", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23804087", "metadata": {"title": "Replication package for \"Cross-domain Specification of Switching Policies in Multi-level Simulation\"", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23804087", "publication_date": "2026-10-30", "description": "<p>Replication package for the manuscript \"Cross-domain Specification of Switching Policies in Multi-level Simulation\" (submitted to the Journal of Systems and Software). It contains the switching specification as an Ecore metamodel with OCL well-formedness constraints, the coding matrices of the coverage and comparative analyses, example and seeded-violation policy instances, the validator and static-analysis tooling, the reference adaptation manager, and the executable scenarios (E-site, traffic, and optional SUMO and Mesa bindings). Running python3 tools/run_evaluation.py (Python 3.9 or later, standard library only) reproduces the evaluation and re-checks every reported result. The SUMO and Mesa studies run when these tools are installed (tested with SUMO 1.27.1 and Mesa 3.3.1 on Python 3.13).</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Weber, Sebastian", "affiliation": "FZI Research Center for Information Technology", "orcid": "0009-0006-3746-0694"}, {"name": "Weber, Thomas", "affiliation": "Karlsruhe Institute of Technology", "orcid": "0009-0001-5775-2225"}, {"name": "Lange, Arne", "affiliation": "University of Mannheim", "orcid": "0000-0002-1776-0247"}, {"name": "Cederbladh, Johan", "affiliation": "Volvo Construction Equipment", "orcid": "0000-0003-2021-8341"}, {"name": "Krems, Daniel", "affiliation": "Anstalt f\u00fcr Verbrennungskraftmaschinen List (Austria)", "orcid": "0009-0007-6444-8604"}, {"name": "Henss, J\u00f6rg", "affiliation": "FZI Research Center for Information Tec